{
  "slug": "job-hunt-skills",
  "name": "Job Hunt Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Practical AI-assisted skills, prompts, guides, and templates to give you an edge in your job search. Open source and free — designed to work with the AI subscription you already pay for.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `claim-check` (Use when the user wants a final truth pass before submitting a resume, CV, cover letter, LinkedIn section,…), `company-research` (Use when the user wants to vet a company or role before applying, understand whether an employer is…), `cover-letter` (Use when the user wants a cover letter for a specific role, company, or tightly defined target lane,…), `get-started` (Use when the user is new to Job Hunt Skills and wants to see what it does or…), `interview-coach` (Use when the user has an upcoming interview, received an interview invitation, or wants to prepare for a…), `interviewing` (Use when the user gets an interview invitation, moves into an interview process, wants to track interview stages,…), `linkedin-optimizer` (Use when the user wants to improve their LinkedIn profile, rewrite their headline, about, or experience sections, or…), `proof-asset-creator` (Use when the user wants to figure out what proof-of-value asset to build — case study, portfolio piece,…), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install job-hunt-skills@claude-community` from `Remotivated/job-hunt-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
